<title>USA: Casino America sees FY Q2 loss.</title>
<headline>Casino America sees FY Q2 loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Casino America said</p>
<p>Friday it anticipated a loss in its fiscal year second quarter.</p>
<p>The stock was halted. No further details were immediately available.  </p>
<p>The company owns and operates three riverboat and dockside casinos in Biloxi and Vicksburg, Miss., and Bossier City, La.</p>
<p>In the year ago second quarter the company earned $0.13 per share. The stock has traded at a year-high of 9-3/4 and a low of 3-3/4.</p>
</text>
